# gpui-fast-apple 0.1.17: display BGRA surfaces.
#
# CoreVideo buffers in kCVPixelFormatType_32BGRA are drawn as one BGRA8Unorm texture
# through a plain textured-quad fragment (surface_bgra_fragment), sampled like the
# image sprites, so colours match the readback path. NV12 surfaces are unchanged.
# Apply from vendor/ with: patch -p1 -d gpui-fast-apple < patches/<this file>

